==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|tolmetsche|lang=goh}}. Compare Proto-Slavic {{m|sla-pro|*tъlmačь||interpreter}} (Russian {{term|sc=Cyrl|толмач|tr=tolmáč|lang=ru}}, Polish {{term|tłumacz|lang=pl}}), whence borrowed from a {{etyl|trk|de}} language; compare Proto-Turkic {{m|trk-pro|*tilmaç}} (Turkish {{term|dil|lang=tr}}, Azeri {{term|dil|lang=az}}).

